 and club singles (\"Whistle While You Twurk\", \"Ying Yang In This Thang\", \"Say I Yi Yi\" and \"By Myself\") to their credit. The instant success of both \"Whistle While You Twurk\" and \"Ying Yang In This Thang\" made Ying Yang Twins immediate players in the hip-hop field. Subsequent hits, \"Say I Yi Yi\" and \"By Myself\" established Kaine and D-Roc as hip-hop’s premier party-starters and earned them guest spots on albums from from Lil Jon & The East Side Boyz and Kizzy Rock.\r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:165375","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":671882,"name":"D'eongelo Holmes"},{"active":true,"id":688659,"name":"Eric Jackson (3)"}],"namevariations":["Da Ying Yang Twins","Marcus","The Ying Yan Twins","The Ying Yang Twins","The Ying-yang Twinz","Ting Yang Twins","Y.Y.T.","Y.Yang","YYT","Yin Yang Twins","Yin Yang Twinz","Ying","Ying Gang Twins","Ying Yang","Ying Yang Twins Interlude","Ying Yang Twinz","Ying Yany Twinz","Ying-Yang Twins"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/165375-Ying-Yang-Twins","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.yingyangmusic.com/","http://www.myspace.com/yingyangtwins","https://twitter.com/yingyangtwins","http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ying_Yang_Twins"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/167876/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"167876","image":"https://i.discogs.com/qLE5i-r847--QlWivUh3KlvalB9OcMeNPZVD_keYKas/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE2Nzg3/Ni0xNjQyNzkxOTQy/LTYxNjguanBlZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/Zk4atckYESSXoxijG0dYKr5S6B2dEr7A_XsV4tS_IFg/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE2Nzg3/Ni0xNjQyNzkxOTQy/LTYxNjguanBlZw.jpeg","profile":"Brazilian songwriter, arranger, conductor, and guitar player.\r\n\r\nb.: June 17, 1945 - Rio De Janeiro, RJ, Brazil.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:167876","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariation